<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://stackpath.bootstrapcdn.com/bootstrap/4.5.0/css/bootstrap.min.css"
        integrity="sha384-9aIt2nRpC12Uk9gS9baDl411NQApFmC26EwAOH8WgZl5MYYxFfc+NcPb1dKGj7Sk" crossorigin="anonymous">
    <link rel="icon" href="img/icons/logo.png" type="image/icon">
    <link href="https://unpkg.com/aos@2.3.1/dist/aos.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/facilities.css">
    <title>Facilities</title>
</head>

<body>
    <%- include('templates/header-1.ejs') -%>
        <header class="facilities-header reveal">
            <h1 class="facilities-page-title">Facilities</h1>
        </header>
        <section class="facilities-section">
            <div class="section-wrapper">
                <div class="facilities-intro reveal">
                    <p>The placement office is fully equipped to efficiently support all stages of the recruitment procedure. Our staff will handle all arrangements for interviews, group discussions, and pre-placement talks. We have various well-equipped facilities to facilitate these processes, including:</p>
                </div>
              
                <div class="facilities-grid reveal">
                    <!-- Left: Navigation Sidebar -->
                    <div class="facilities-nav">
                        <div class="prog">
                            <button class="nav-tab-btn active" id="btn-1">
                                <svg class="tab-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                                    <rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
                                    <line x1="8" y1="21" x2="16" y2="21"></line>
                                    <line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12" y2="21"></line>
                                </svg>
                                <span>Smart class-rooms</span>
                            </button>
                            <button class="nav-tab-btn" id="btn-2">
                                <svg class="tab-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                                    <path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"></path>
                                </svg>
                                <span>Interview & GD halls</span>
                            </button>
                            <button class="nav-tab-btn" id="btn-3">
                                <svg class="tab-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                                    <rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
                                    <line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"></line>
                                    <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
                                </svg>
                                <span>Computer labs</span>
                            </button>
                            <button class="nav-tab-btn" id="btn-4">
                                <svg class="tab-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                                    <path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path>
                                    <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle>
                                    <path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path>
                                    <path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"></path>
                                </svg>
                                <span>Placement volunteers</span>
                            </button>
                            <button class="nav-tab-btn" id="btn-5">
                                <svg class="tab-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                                    <path d="M23 7a2 2 0 0 0-2.45-1.45L16 7V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H2a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-2l4.55 1.45A2 2 0 0 0 23 17V7z"></path>
                                </svg>
                                <span>Video conferencing</span>
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <!-- Right: Display Area -->
                    <div class="facilities-display-area">
                        <div class="facility-card-wrapper">
                            <div class="facility-card" id="box-1" style="display: flex;">
                                <div class="facility-image-container">
                                    <img class="facility-image" src="/img/facilities/smart_classroom.jpg" alt="Smart class-rooms" loading="lazy">
                                </div>
                                <div class="facility-content">
                                    <h2 class="facility-title">Smart class-rooms</h2>
                                    <p class="facility-text">Our smart lecture halls come with the best technology and provide a conducive atmosphere for dynamic and focused discussions between the speakers and the audience.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="facility-card-wrapper">
                            <div class="facility-card" id="box-2" style="display: none;">
                                <div class="facility-image-container">
                                    <img class="facility-image" src="/img/facilities/2.jpeg" alt="Interview rooms and GD halls" loading="lazy">
                                </div>
                                <div class="facility-content">
                                    <h2 class="facility-title">Interview rooms and Group discussions halls</h2>
                                    <p class="facility-text">A very minimalistic yet expansive looking space for conducting interviews, group discussions, pre-placement talks, and other assessment processes with absolute comfort and privacy.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="facility-card-wrapper">
                            <div class="facility-card" id="box-3" style="display: none;">
                                <div class="facility-image-container">
                                    <img class="facility-image" src="/img/facilities/computer_lab.jpg" alt="Computer labs" loading="lazy">
                                </div>
                                <div class="facility-content">
                                    <h2 class="facility-title">Computer labs</h2>
                                    <p class="facility-text">The college has high-tech all-in-one computer systems enabled with extremely fast internet access through LAN and WiFi (>100 Mbps). These systems are equipped with cutting-edge hardware configurations and connected to a central server.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="facility-card-wrapper">
                            <div class="facility-card" id="box-4" style="display: none;">
                                <div class="facility-image-container">
                                    <img class="facility-image" src="/img/facilities/team.jpg" alt="Student placement volunteers" loading="lazy">
                                </div>
                                <div class="facility-content">
                                    <h2 class="facility-title">Student placement volunteers</h2>
                                    <p class="facility-text">Our dedicated student placement volunteers are trained and available to assist on the day of the visit and guide candidates through the entire selection and evaluation process seamlessly.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="facility-card-wrapper">
                            <div class="facility-card" id="box-5" style="display: none;">
                                <div class="facility-image-container">
                                    <img class="facility-image" src="/img/facilities/1.jpeg" alt="Video conferencing facilities" loading="lazy">
                                </div>
                                <div class="facility-content">
                                    <h2 class="facility-title">Video conferencing facilities</h2>
                                    <p class="facility-text">State-of-the-art video conferencing rooms equipped with high-definition audio and visual gear are available for virtual interviews, online meetings, and remote recruitment sessions.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <script src="scripts/facilities.js"></script>
            </div>
        </section>
           

                <%- include('templates/footer-1.ejs') -%>
</body>

</html>
